s, story fragments, and challenging decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Risk vs. Reward:</strong> Push your luck to reap greater rewards, but beware - one wrong move could end your run and doom humanity.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique blend of deckbuilding, real-time combat, and sci-fi exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform and modify cards during combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully realized 3D environments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedurally generated lunar core ensures no two runs are alike </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep, strategic gameplay with endless deck-building possibilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Atmospheric sci-fi setting with a mysterious alien threat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Roguelike progression system that rewards both skill and strategy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity's fate rests in your hands. Will you rise to the challenge and become the hero Earth needs? Dive into the Night Machine and find out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/e346f9be71b787b51295c0f902de3a21.poster.avif?t=1754172368\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/e346f9be71b787b51295c0f902de3a21.webm?t=1754172368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
